pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.6<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">February 18, 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150720234319&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Power_Bolt_07a833.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a power bolt.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by players of level 55 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.90 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Very useful for hunting strong creatures with a blocker, since you can stay at a good range (depends on your Crossbow).<br/>\nCan be obtained from the <a href=\"#/quest/power-bolts-quest\">Power Bolts Quest</a> and the Formorgar Mine Quest. 100 of these can also be obtained by clearing the Scrapper Arena during the <a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-arena-quest\">Barbarian Arena Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Once the most powerful bolt, but was superseded in the 2006 Winter Update, when <a href=\"#/wiki/Infernal%20Bolt\">Infernal Bolts</a> were implemented.\n</p><p>Before the Summer Update 2007 it looked different from now. It looked like this: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Power Bolt (old)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Power_Bolt_old_726c8a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>. You can now buy it from NPCs for 7 gp, but before you could only loot it from some <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a>, buy it from players or conjure 10 for 800 mana with the old Conjure Power Bolt spell.\n</p><p>Before the Summer Update 2017, Royal Paladins could conjure 10 of these using the spell Conjure Power Bolt. The spell has now been removed.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Albino%20Dragon\">Albino Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Betrayed%20Wraith\">Betrayed Wraith</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broodrider%20Inferniarch\">Broodrider Inferniarch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demodras\">Demodras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Wyrm\">Elder Wyrm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Dragon\">Frost Dragon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/General%20Murius\">General Murius</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Kalyassa\">Kalyassa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Nightmare\">Nightmare</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Omruc\">Omruc</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Spawn\">Serpent Spawn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Undead%20Dragon\">Undead Dragon</a></li>\n